    "Ignore positive sentiment signals (0.20) in the history as they are insufficient to halt the dominant bearish trend; do not allow forecasts to recover above 60 EUR until the true outcome shows sustained stabilization.",
    "Correct for 'overshoot' behavior: the model's slight upward drift in later horizons (days 20-30) is incorrect; forecasts should flatten or continue a gentle decline to match the true outcome's volatility around 56-59 EUR."
